<title>DENMARK: SOCCER-BRONDBY V TENERIFE TEAMS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BRONDBY V TENERIFE TEAMS.</headline>
<dateline>BRONDBY, Denmark 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Teams for Tuesday's UEFA Cup quarter-final second leg between Denmark's Brondby and Tenerife of Spain:</p>
<p>Brondby: 1-Mogens Krogh; 14-Soeren Colding, 4-Per Nielsen, 16-Dan Eggen, 23-Anders Bjerregaard, 2-Ole Bjur, 11-Kim Vilfort,8-Kim Daugaard, 12-Ebbe Sand, 15-Ruben Bagger, 9-Peter Moeller</p>
<p>Tenerife: 1-Marcelo Ojeda, 2-Julio Llorente Gento, 5-Antonio Olivera, 8-Sebastian Cruzado, 16-Antonio Pinilla, 15-Oliver Neuville, 12-Sergio Ballestinos, 26-Sizwe Motaung, 14-Angel Vivar Dorado, 6-Slavisa Jokanovic, 11-Juanele Castanos.</p>
</text>
